  "training": {
    "hints": [
      "A NEXT and B NEXT cycle manual DINT values 0, 1, 2, 5, 10.",
      "FUNC NEXT cycles 0, 1 SUM, 2 PRODUCT, 99 invalid. Only 1 and 2 are supported.",
      "OPERANDS, FUNC VALID and CALCULATE are manual permissives. The program must also validate the numeric choice."
    ],
    "solution": {
      "summary": "Original offline reference: Main calls FB_Selector, which conditionally calls FC_Sum or FC_Product using global symbolic tags. FB parameter transfer and instance-local memory are not modeled.",
      "steps": [
        "Open programs/examples/09-function-selector-reference.rpproj.json in Project > Open, verify and load offline, then Run.",
        "Set A=2 and B=5, enable OPERANDS, FUNC VALID and CALCULATE. Choice 1 gives RESULT 7; choice 2 gives RESULT 10.",
        "Choice 0 or 99, or a lost permissive, clears result-valid and retains the last numeric result. Stop clears the output image; Reset clears all values and inputs."
      ],
      "acceptance": "Only the selected supported path executes: 1 SUM produces 7 and 2 PRODUCT produces 10 for A=2, B=5. Unsupported choices never assert selected_result_valid."
    },
    "assetRequirements": [
      "Three labeled manual permissive/request pushbuttons",
      "Three clickable live DINT input readouts",
      "Live PLC-owned DINT result readout and validity indicator"
    ],
    "machineGuide": {
      "purpose": "Select A, B and function: 1 SUM, 2 PRODUCT. Confirm both validity flags and CALCULATE; the loaded ladder program owns RESULT.",
